  "id": "talking-cure",
  "term": "talking cure",
  "definition": "The talking cure is a common way of describing psychotherapy as a form of help that works through speaking and interaction. In this sense, it refers to approaches that focus on how language use in therapy can contribute to psychological change and relief of problems.",
